[section, $md:
    # Numeric backend contract

    This reference defines the numeric operation contract shared by the
    compiler, optimisers and backends. It separates arithmetic semantics from
    failure delivery and records how constraint guarantees reach a lowerer.

    The user-facing source contract, proof policy and constraint meanings live
    in @../../docs/directives/#constraints (Constraints). That page owns source
    placement and acceptance. This page owns the numeric rules a backend must
    preserve.
]

[section, numeric_backend_contract]
